{"id":"x-arith-iadd-checked-overflow-err-arm-runs","rules":["OP-1"],"expect":{"exit":0,"kind":"run"},"status":"runnable","doc":"iadd.checked returns Result<T, Overflow>; on i32::MAX + 1 it yields Err and exits 0, while an unexpected Ok arm returns a nonzero status. This combines a table op returning Result with an observable match outcome."}
{"id":"x-arith-loop-checked-multiply-overflow","rules":["OP-1","SCOPE-3"],"expect":{"exit":0,"kind":"run"},"status":"runnable","doc":"A loop uses checked multiplication and handles the first overflow as an expected typed value through ordinary control [OP-1, SCOPE-3]."}
