{"id":"x-gram-call-repeated-arg","rules":["GRAM-11"],"expect":{"kind":"reject","rule":"GRAM-11"},"status":"runnable","doc":"GRAM-11 repeated argument name: calling add2 with (x, x) is rejected because the second slot must name declared parameter y \u2014 a repeat is never a reordering license; a subtle violation kind beyond the existing misspelled/out-of-order/unnamed negatives."}
