{"id":"x-form-form2-tab-indent","rules":["FORM-2"],"expect":{"kind":"reject","rule":"FORM-2"},"status":"runnable","doc":"Tab-character indentation violates the canonical two-spaces-per-level byte format and is a hard error; isolates the tab variant the existing four-space case does not exercise [FORM-2]."}
