{"id":"x-form-form4-block-comment","rules":["FORM-4"],"expect":{"kind":"reject","rule":"FORM-4"},"status":"runnable","doc":"There are no comments; a C-style block comment (/* ... */) is a hard error, distinct from the existing line-comment negative, so both comment syntaxes are pinned [FORM-4]."}
