{"id":"x-fn-arg-type-mismatch","rules":["FN-1","TYPE-5"],"expect":{"kind":"reject","rule":"TYPE-5"},"status":"runnable","doc":"A call passes a Bool-typed argument (a fresh True() construction, so no affine/OWN-1 confound) where the signature declares i32; argument types must match declared parameter types exactly [TYPE-5], relying only on the signature [FN-1]."}
