{"id":"x-enum-payload-give","rules":["TYPE-2","GRAM-8","GRAM-10","GIVE-1","OP-1"],"expect":{"exit":0,"kind":"run"},"status":"runnable","doc":"A payload-carrying enum variant is constructed [GRAM-8], matched with a named binder [GRAM-10], and the bound payload feeds total wrapping arithmetic delivered by give in a value-match [GIVE-1]. The enum tag and payload lowering round-trip the value through code generation and the case exits 0."}
{"id":"x-enum-multiwidth-dispatch","rules":["TYPE-2","TYPE-6","GRAM-10","ENT-3","OP-2"],"expect":{"exit":0,"kind":"run"},"status":"runnable","doc":"An enum whose type-owned variants [TYPE-6] carry payloads of different widths lowers to one payload slot sized to the widest. Each variant is passed by value to a cross-function match [GRAM-10] and copied out at its declared width; the signed remainder interval proves the Small-arm exact increment, and the observed sum confirms every payload round-trip."}
{"id":"x-enum-borrow-payload-live","rules":["OWN-13","GIVE-1","GRAM-10","REF-1","TYPE-7"],"expect":{"exit":0,"kind":"run"},"status":"runnable","doc":"A payload enum is matched twice through references [OWN-13]: reference-mode matching leaves the scrutinee live for the second read, each payload binder names the scrutinee path extended by its payload step [REF-1, GRAM-10], and each binder is itself a reference, so its value is reached through deref to feed a give-delivered computation [TYPE-7, GIVE-1]; the accumulated total pins both reads and it runs to exit 0."}
{"id":"x-enum-stmt-payload-check","rules":["TYPE-2","GRAM-10","OWN-13","OP-1","OP-2","ENT-3"],"expect":{"exit":0,"kind":"run"},"status":"runnable","doc":"A statement-position owned-payload match normalizes the arm-local value by signed remainder. The operation's deterministic result interval proves the exact multiplication; ordinary controls observe 42 and reject the unexpected Nil arm."}
