{"id":"fn8-neg-entry-contract","rules":["FN-7","FN-8"],"expect":{"kind":"accept"},"status":"runnable","doc":"C2 retires the FN-7 entry-contract prohibition. The original false requirement is preserved and gives ordinary FN-8 uninhabited acceptance. The case is not executed and the launcher must never fabricate a proof of its requirement."}
