{"id":"fn8-pos-requires-name-reuse","rules":["FN-8","TYPE-6"],"expect":{"exit":0,"kind":"run"},"status":"runnable","doc":"Because requirement locals do not leak into the function body, the body may reuse the same spelling as a fresh binding; the accepted program runs to exit 0."}
