{"id":"fn4-neg-formal-row-coverage","rules":["FN-4","FN-1","EFF-1"],"expect":{"kind":"reject","rule":"FN-4"},"status":"runnable","doc":"FN-4 requires every actual effect path to be covered in the same category by the formal row. The v0.59 case exceeded a reads-only formal by allocating; allocation now carries no effect entry, so the excess is an ordinary write through a reference parameter."}
