{"id":"x-enum-twostate-result-payload","rules":["TYPE-2","ERR-1","PRE-1"],"expect":{"exit":0,"kind":"run"},"status":"runnable","doc":"A Bool-isomorphic two-variant tag-only enum remains typed as Flag across Ok, Err, Some, and None call boundaries; nested matches exercise both tags after the erased i64 ABI payload is reconstructed."}
